{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner entrepreneur! Balance renovation, product selection, customer service, and outdoor ambiance to build the ultimate caf\u00e9 experience and keep your customers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/3225af715d69915509be448693f54292.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/09d48d66f94309fa76a8c5650686980c.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/09d48d66f94309fa76a8c5650686980c.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/09d48d66f94309fa76a8c5650686980c.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order a diverse selection of products to keep your shelves stocked and your clients happy. Whether it\u2019s gourmet coffee beans, delectable pastries, or artisanal snacks, the right inventory will set you apart from the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/5639847a51b244acdc035e3caeffae23.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/3f9a2174507b46c5ca3e79a652f7ba6d.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/3f9a2174507b46c5ca3e79a652f7ba6d.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/3f9a2174507b46c5ca3e79a652f7ba6d.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a savvy barista in your very own coffee shop! Buy best ingredients and craft delicious beverages tailored to your customers\u2019 tastes, from rich espressos to frothy lattes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/5add5a711587d1822dd1dd2e7a5694ee.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/79238e6a99e65690c7d0e018d01371bd.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/79238e6a99e65690c7d0e018d01371bd.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/79238e6a99e65690c7d0e018d01371bd.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect cards, you unlock a diverse array of stylish sales racks and coffee machines options. Then arrange and test layouts to optimize both flow and aesthetic appeal, ensuring every corner invites customers to relax and enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/696cd77471eaf77edce6adb5b9e66810.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/a6b9bf74bf2935bca7b46ded4202458c.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/a6b9bf74bf2935bca7b46ded4202458c.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/a6b9bf74bf2935bca7b46ded4202458c.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of serving a diverse clientele, each with unique preferences and expectations. Master the art of quick and efficient service to boost your caf\u00e9's reputation and keep customers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/b3d17e2727a9538c3c9163b28dbf2e07.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/1cb2e7b0ac4e3b62b13d1469dedcc5c8.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/1cb2e7b0ac4e3b62b13d1469dedcc5c8.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/1cb2e7b0ac4e3b62b13d1469dedcc5c8.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your outdoor area into a charming haven decorative plants, customizable canopy and ambient lighting. Crafting a cozy outdoor atmosphere not only enhances your cafe's appeal but also creates the perfect spot for customers to unwind and savor their experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/6bedb8e32ac6465bee67c763e2024030.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/829ba0a8f41c3c557db16a4bbe9de472.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/829ba0a8f41c3c557db16a4bbe9de472.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/829ba0a8f41c3c557db16a4bbe9de472.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a spotless environment to ensure customer satisfaction. Regularly cleaning and organizing your cafe not only enhances the ambiance but also encourages positive reviews and repeat visits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/ffe3520a864edd8c1dcb2c9b543fe81f.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/f03637f4ce7fab513f9c66854e57b53e.poster.avif?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/f03637f4ce7fab513f9c66854e57b53e.webm?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/f03637f4ce7fab513f9c66854e57b53e.mp4?t=1757595459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the challenges of running a cafe as you strive to become the top choice in town. By focusing on exceptional service, delicious offerings, and a warm ambiance, you'll attract a loyal customer base and turn your cafe into a beloved local hotspot.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078950?t=1757595459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3078950?t=1757595459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/85077810dcddd5af0710464d101975f725f1ddc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757595459","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/85077810dcddd5af0710464d101975f725f1ddc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757595459","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3333170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your inner entrepreneur! Balance renovation, product selection, customer service, and outdoor ambiance to build the ultimate caf\u00e9 experience and keep your customers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078950/extras/3225af715d69915509be448693f54292.webp?t=1757595459\" width=610 height=49 /></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vide